@startuml
actor "家庭成员" as User
participant "前端看板" as UI
participant "HTTP API" as API
participant "告警与联动服务" as AlertService
participant "设备服务" as DeviceService
database "SQLite" as DB

User -> UI : 点击“触发模拟告警”
UI -> API : POST /api/alerts/simulate
API -> AlertService : simulate_alert(event_type, room_id)
AlertService -> DB : 写入 alerts
AlertService -> DB : 写入 recordings
AlertService -> DeviceService : 执行联动策略
DeviceService -> DB : 更新警报器/灯光/摄像头状态
AlertService -> DB : 写入 operation_logs
API --> UI : 返回告警详情
UI --> User : 展示告警、录像和设备联动结果
@enduml
